WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,480
After such a long road, I can finally eat enough today

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,600
Finish it first and then talk

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,310
You see, having more people is still useful, right?

4
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,710
Only useful people are useful

5
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:17,060
Sister Fei, do it too

6
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,980
Since I'm following you, there's no reason to just stand and divide the meat equally.

7
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,940
This sentence is more useful than everyone is a family

8
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:25,420
Next time you have such a big job, you can book the number of people in advance

9
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,500
If there are too many people, there will be less points. If there are too few people, the efficiency will be low.

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,700
Can recruit people on a job basis

11
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,100
You can't say something nice

12
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,220
Is the meal good enough?

13
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:35,190
Boss, eat first

14
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:36,310
My mouth is so sweet today

15
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:37,470
I’m afraid you won’t recruit workers next time

16
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:39,500
what is this

17
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,380
I can’t just listen to you arguing and playing games every day after eating.

18
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:45,020
It’s boring to win or lose without punishment. I agree.

19
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,300
Who do you two want to tease?

20
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:52,640
you are a singer

21
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:55,040
Then sing a sweet song that you would never sing on stage.

22
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,360
I knew you had no good intentions
